  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To offer policy guidance and technical support regarding Financing for Development and nature capital solutions to the Government of Pakistan, UNDP Pakistan has set up an SDG Investment and Climate Financing Facility. The objective is to identify, cultivate, and harness high-impact SDG-aligned and climate financing opportunities with the potential to attract investments from domestic and international investors, including financial markets. The project will offer technical assistance and build</narrative>
